{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "861fef3e-8a74-5dfc-a4a0-0288640bc5a6", "source_ordinal": 2716, "reading_ordinal": 1337, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "亲密关系的充分理由", "published_at": "2022-06-28T01:23:07+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/540214555/answer/2548225605"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "爱与不爱，其实是看对方的人生追求值不值得你牺牲。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 24}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "不是看对方对你好不好。", "char_start": 25, "char_end": 36}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这关系是这样的——如果对方的事业是野心勃勃地要扩展人的知识、改善人类的生活或者国家的安全之类，而且是真诚的，那么这人自然会在意这些任务的需求细节，会练出观察力来，", "char_start": 37, "char_end": 118}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "加上真诚地追求这些事业本来就是出自非常积极的价值观，自然而然也会对身边人有体贴之意。", "char_start": 119, "char_end": 161}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "说句坦率话——亲密关系天生注定是要毫无保障地牺牲的。", "char_start": 162, "char_end": 188}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "不错，这里面当然会有甜蜜的地方，有温馨的地方，但还是躲不过那些毫无保障只能冒险牺牲的地方。", "char_start": 189, "char_end": 234}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "而且在后者面前，前面的这些甜蜜、温馨都微不足道。", "char_start": 235, "char_end": 259}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "也不用感到纠结害怕，因为恰恰是这些冒险和牺牲才是感情里最核心、最有价值、最享受的部分。", "char_start": 260, "char_end": 303}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "“辛辛苦苦给ta做牛做马，结果钱没赚到还对我不好。”", "char_start": 304, "char_end": 330}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "“做牛做马感”是绝对避不开的，“对我不好感”也是绝对避不开的，“钱没赚到感”也是大概率事件。", "char_start": 331, "char_end": 377}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "换句话来说，“辛辛苦苦给ta做牛做马，结果钱没赚到还对我不好”是必然会出现的感觉，而且会长期反复地浮现，每一次都会是致命的折磨。", "char_start": 378, "char_end": 442}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "真正的救赎，是“我不是为一个自私自利、只是为了自己而活的人牺牲”。", "char_start": 443, "char_end": 476}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "我牺牲的东西，通过这个人自己的人生追求而对很多其他的人有益。这个才是能屡屡把你从亏损感、枯竭感、沮丧感里捞出来的真正屏障。", "char_start": 477, "char_end": 538}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "反正都要冒险牺牲，不如赌在这样的人身上。如果的确没有得到个人的回报，你好歹可以自言自语——“相对论 / 003 / 社会治安 / 粮食安全 / 农村教育 ……里有我一份真正的功劳”。", "char_start": 539, "char_end": 630}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "有这个东西打底，你常会令人意外的不沮丧、不枯竭。", "char_start": 631, "char_end": 655}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "出人意料地不沮丧、不枯竭，不是指你完全不沮丧、不枯竭，而是指原本对方自己都沮丧到100分了，自己都觉得你必然至少沮丧到120分，在家提心吊胆连气都不敢出，结果会发现你的沮丧只有80分。", "char_start": 656, "char_end": 748}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "ta自己都觉得自己枯竭了，以为你肯定也该枯竭了，结果意外发现你的水龙头还有水在滴。", "char_start": 749, "char_end": 790}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "凡在危难之中经历过这种刚毅的，没一个舍得离开这刚毅的源泉。", "char_start": 791, "char_end": 820}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "这种令人意外的不沮丧、不枯竭，会始终成为彼此感情里的定海神针，在对方自己都痛苦绝望的时候给对方极大的安慰和信心。", "char_start": 821, "char_end": 877}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "这东西是对方在激烈竞争中最大的优势之一。", "char_start": 878, "char_end": 898}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "同样抗压力，对方失眠还要在家里吵架闹离婚，你家只失眠，不吵架不离婚还可以得安慰得信心。自然你家赢面大。", "char_start": 899, "char_end": 950}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "是这个安慰使得对方知道你的价值，永远在意你的存在——而不是对方的性欲冲动、婚育压力这类转瞬即逝的东西。", "char_start": 951, "char_end": 1002}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "而恰好对称的——要维持这种刚毅的表现，靠“ta毕竟对我很好/好过”“这是女人的本分”这种心态去撑是撑不住的。", "char_start": 1003, "char_end": 1057}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "因为这种“恩情”“交情”的可替代性很强，效力也有限，你凭借这个忍受牺牲，忍不了三天就会意识到“别人对我也挺好，ta也没好到哪里去”。ta给过你1000，另一个人可以给你1200，何况1000也不是永远花不完。何况你要做的很多决定都是命运的豪赌，哪里是几千几万能摆平的？", "char_start": 1058, "char_end": 1192}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "不管是1000，还是1200，其实都配不上你的牺牲和风险。通过所谓婚前的大方来赌婚后的恩爱，其实是几乎没有可靠性的。", "char_start": 1193, "char_end": 1251}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "至于“女人的本分“，难道女人就不是人？这想法在几十年前作为默认信仰还是有力的，但现在已经没有能力支撑了。", "char_start": 1252, "char_end": 1304}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "只有意识到自己的牺牲即使没有换到任何个人利益，也会通过对方的努力换到某种公共利益，无论如何不会毫无意义，可以撑住你的刚毅，提供出人意料的不沮丧、不枯竭。", "char_start": 1305, "char_end": 1381}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "天道乐善，顺天即乐善。", "char_start": 1383, "char_end": 1394}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "顺天者昌，这人自然不至于匮乏。", "char_start": 1395, "char_end": 1410}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "乐善而不匮乏，自然有意愿也有更大的概率给你你想要的安全。", "char_start": 1411, "char_end": 1439}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "你为这样的人服务和牺牲，自己本身就是顺天而行，上面这一连串的由刚毅而生依靠、由依靠而生出色、由出色而生成功、由成功而生保障的机制，只是顺天者昌的自然路径。这条路的后半段要看概率，但是“由刚毅而生依靠”这一步却在你的手里。", "char_start": 1440, "char_end": 1550}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "总而言之，关系值不值得继续，不是看对方有多少钱、谈恋爱大不大方、会不会殷情小意，而是看对方选择的事业是什么，为什么要选这个事业，谈起它是不是眼里有光，以及为这么热爱的事业做了哪些真诚的努力。", "char_start": 1551, "char_end": 1646}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "是这个人值不值得成为你牺牲的理由。", "char_start": 1647, "char_end": 1664}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "三人同心\n最高效的找对象途径是什么？", "char_start": 1665, "char_end": 1683}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 36}, "divergence": true, "divergence_count": 1}, "text_lexical_divergence": [{"reason": "text_tail_not_in_lexical", "paragraph_kind": "tail", "char_start": 1665, "sample": "三人同心\n最高效的找对象途径是什么？"}]}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0212"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：我应该继续和这样的男朋友在一起吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034"], "summary": "围绕“亲密关系的充分理由”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“爱与不爱，其实是看对方的人生追求值不值得你牺牲。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "爱与不爱，其实是看对方的人生追求值不值得你牺牲。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 24, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "5ef5017a-546e-5792-a433-323a1efbcda8", "source_ordinal": 2715, "reading_ordinal": 1338, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "贪爱相生", "published_at": "2022-06-28T20:34:35+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/22958948/answer/2549539718"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "贪婪是爱最好的伙伴。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 10}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "问题是这样的——", "char_start": 11, "char_end": 19}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "贪婪的效用是负值。", "char_start": 20, "char_end": 29}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "爱的效用是正值。", "char_start": 30, "char_end": 38}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "当你又贪又爱一个人，那么你的关系的净效用就是贪婪效用+爱的效用。", "char_start": 39, "char_end": 71}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "举个例子，贪是-5，爱是+6，那么关系的净效用就是+1。", "char_start": 72, "char_end": 100}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "但是要怎么计算你的爱呢？是算你+6还是+1呢？", "char_start": 101, "char_end": 124}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "算+6。", "char_start": 125, "char_end": 129}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "你的贪婪愈烈，当你战胜了它，好歹结出了一个净贡献的果子，你的爱就愈强。", "char_start": 130, "char_end": 165}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "有人问——那么何其不如只爱自己不贪求的人，那不是就可以把+6一点都不浪费的直接用上吗？那么净贡献岂不就直接就是+6了吗？", "char_start": 166, "char_end": 226}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "唉，可惜事情不是这样安排的。", "char_start": 227, "char_end": 241}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "上帝在这开了个玩笑——那就是当-5不存在，也就是不存在需要你克服的贪婪，那么你自然而然的会爱得“优雅”，轻巧又机灵，若即若离，净输出还是+1。", "char_start": 242, "char_end": 313}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "你要能把爱提升到+6，主要的前提就是你有-5的贪求。", "char_start": 314, "char_end": 340}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "就像一只很欠打的球队，遇到中国也是1-0，遇到巴西还是1-0。", "char_start": 341, "char_end": 372}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "它能发挥最强水平的前提，就是打巴西。", "char_start": 373, "char_end": 391}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "看明白没有？巴西其实不是这支球队的敌人。", "char_start": 392, "char_end": 412}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "所以，在你能保证净贡献的前提下，爱你最贪求的人，是有充分的理由的。", "char_start": 413, "char_end": 446}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "贪是紧紧的拥抱，爱是收起自己的尖刺外加额外的帮助。", "char_start": 448, "char_end": 473}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "不收尖刺，抱得越紧，对方伤得越重，死得越快。", "char_start": 474, "char_end": 496}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "但这绝不是选择“干脆不拥抱、也不需要收起尖刺、远远的挥挥手”作为“替代方案”的理由。", "char_start": 497, "char_end": 539}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "因为尽管这两个方案的痛苦程度、净贡献都相等，但是“紧紧拥抱 + 收起尖刺 + 额外帮助”帮你净赚了一个紧紧拥抱。", "char_start": 540, "char_end": 596}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "打就要打巴西，甭想着打中国。", "char_start": 598, "char_end": 612}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "打巴西1:0，就一定比打中国3:0吃亏了吗？", "char_start": 613, "char_end": 635}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "贪婪也没那么简单。", "char_start": 636, "char_end": 645}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "贪婪也是分品味的。", "char_start": 646, "char_end": 655}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "贪求建功立业的成就感也是贪，贪求海洛因的快感也是贪。", "char_start": 656, "char_end": 682}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "后者会让毒贩子看上去眉清目秀，这个坑要用爱填平可不容易。", "char_start": 683, "char_end": 711}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 30}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0212"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：怎么理解贪婪？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027"], "summary": "围绕“贪爱相生”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“贪婪是爱最好的伙伴。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "贪婪是爱最好的伙伴。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 10, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "6e071723-872f-51dc-992c-3b28ef18fc10", "source_ordinal": 2714, "reading_ordinal": 1339, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "首要意义", "published_at": "2022-06-29T08:35:23+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/61467321/answer/2550023022"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "人类做很多事情的意义其实都是为了解决自己内在的痛苦。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 26}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这个在上帝设计人类的时候先埋藏好了，到了时候痛苦就会开始发生，为了解决痛苦你就要去做某种努力。", "char_start": 27, "char_end": 74}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "就跟痒了就要挠一样。", "char_start": 75, "char_end": 85}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这是最大、最直接的意义，非常朴素。", "char_start": 86, "char_end": 103}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "如果你不痒，你也就不会觉得“挠”有意义。给“挠”找出宏伟的社会学、文化学、人类学、经济学，哲学上的重大价值，其实都不足以成就这东西的意义。", "char_start": 104, "char_end": 173}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "“不这么做难受，做了就不难受”，这基本是一切行为的主要意义——甚至可能实际上是它们的全部意义。", "char_start": 174, "char_end": 221}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "战争的意义是为了消除不战争的直观痛苦，和平的意义是为了消除不和平的直观痛苦。", "char_start": 222, "char_end": 260}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "其它的“意义”其实是为了稳固自己行为的合理性而另外做的构建，是第二位的。属于“来都来了”“干都干了”之后为了维持自己不要半途而废而寻找的助燃剂。", "char_start": 261, "char_end": 333}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这些助燃剂有些看上去非常宏伟，但实际上如果你没有内在的痛苦，只凭这些宏伟事物是很难迈过行动的门槛的。", "char_start": 334, "char_end": 384}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "就像你在这里询问男朋友有什么意义，收集完全部的“好处”之后，只要你并没有求之不得的痛苦，其实你还是什么也不会做一样。", "char_start": 385, "char_end": 443}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "所以，珍惜你的痛苦，这些痛苦是最有用的动力，不要尝试用麻醉剂将它们彻底消除（只能抑制你不能承受的部分），也不要将它们作为作恶的理由。", "char_start": 444, "char_end": 510}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "卡住这两个关键，痛苦反而是你最好的朋友。", "char_start": 511, "char_end": 531}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "否则上帝也不会做这样的设计了。", "char_start": 532, "char_end": 547}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 13}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0212"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：男女朋友存在的意义是什么，谈恋爱的意义何在？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013"], "summary": "围绕“首要意义”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“人类做很多事情的意义其实都是为了解决自己内在的痛苦。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "人类做很多事情的意义其实都是为了解决自己内在的痛苦。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 26, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "816ec4c2-c356-5dd3-99fc-4b7f4dfcebed", "source_ordinal": 2713, "reading_ordinal": 1340, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "敬酒不吃", "published_at": "2022-06-29T10:33:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/539711148/answer/2550212015"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "“哦哦，对不起，是我唐突啦，不好意思啊。”", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 21}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这种事人家自己主权最大，你没啥好反对的呀。", "char_start": 22, "char_end": 43}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "没必要有一点纠结，更要养成习惯不要为人家有权做的事发怒。", "char_start": 44, "char_end": 72}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "不然怎么叫做人家“有权”呢？", "char_start": 73, "char_end": 87}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "有些人给你断交的机会简直是放生一般的功德，值得感谢。不然回头ta们走投无路来求你，你还不好却这个面子。", "char_start": 89, "char_end": 140}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这是喜事，值得庆祝。", "char_start": 141, "char_end": 151}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 7}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0212"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：酒桌上给人倒酒，对方用手盖住杯口，说我没资格给他倒酒，我该如何巧妙的化解？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006"], "summary": "围绕“敬酒不吃”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：““哦哦，对不起，是我唐突啦，不好意思啊。””", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "“哦哦，对不起，是我唐突啦，不好意思啊。”", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 21, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "3156b363-95db-524d-be3f-c6c021d48c67", "source_ordinal": 2712, "reading_ordinal": 1341, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "忠诚", "published_at": "2022-06-29T19:09:41+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/54446994/answer/2551059781"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这个问题恐怕要挑战你们的基本观念，但无论如何还是说出来给你们参考。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 33}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "忠诚这东西，最好来自自愿，而非来自威慑和要求。", "char_start": 34, "char_end": 57}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "也就是你完全有不忠的自由，我自己风险自负。", "char_start": 58, "char_end": 79}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "我一开始就不接受“发誓忠诚”这样的安排。你的忠诚应该来自你自己的意愿，不是来自我的要求、我的交换条件。", "char_start": 80, "char_end": 131}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "我更希望你觉得没有忠诚的必要的时候可以自由的选择结束忠诚。", "char_start": 132, "char_end": 161}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "或者更进一步的说，我都不希望我自己习惯“你肯定会忠诚”这种“安全感”。", "char_start": 162, "char_end": 197}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "我要是习惯了这个安全感，恐怕你不愿再维持忠诚时会感到有压力。", "char_start": 198, "char_end": 228}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "人对人，来去自由，不做任何约束。", "char_start": 229, "char_end": 245}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "所以我不做任何确定谁忠不忠诚的探索。", "char_start": 246, "char_end": 264}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "不搞监视、侦查、审问、推测。", "char_start": 265, "char_end": 279}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "更不必说“惩罚叛徒”。", "char_start": 280, "char_end": 291}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "一切都听凭你的自愿。", "char_start": 292, "char_end": 302}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "当然，你不会平白无故的拥有这样的机会，当然是因为我敢于托付你什么秘密或者软肋才会如此。", "char_start": 303, "char_end": 346}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "但我托付给你了，就承担所有风险的全部责任。承担不起的，我就不托付。", "char_start": 347, "char_end": 380}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "而不是托付给你我承担不起的，然后像秃鹰一样蹲在你头上看守，把你变成我的利益的奴隶。", "char_start": 381, "char_end": 422}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "我有上天的恩宠，即使是死亡，也于我无碍。", "char_start": 423, "char_end": 443}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "真正可惜的，是我这样的人，你一生再难遇到一个。", "char_start": 444, "char_end": 467}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "我的“安全保障”，只是你把我害死了，你就没有我了而已。", "char_start": 468, "char_end": 495}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "我对忠诚没有要求，你不必纠结和紧张。", "char_start": 496, "char_end": 514}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "按你自己想要的去行就是了。", "char_start": 515, "char_end": 528}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "我感觉你们误解了几件事。", "char_start": 529, "char_end": 541}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "第一，这不是在谈“恋爱关系“而已，而是指一切的关系。", "char_start": 542, "char_end": 568}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "第二，如果是有预先约定保密责任、违约责任的合同，那么合同所要求的违约责任是一个履约问题。这跟“忠诚”不是同一个议题。", "char_start": 569, "char_end": 627}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "第三，论及忠诚，这是唯一真正有效的方案。无法用威慑、监视来替代。", "char_start": 628, "char_end": 660}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "后者造成的不是忠诚，而是绑架。如果这算忠诚，那么囚犯对典狱长为什么不叫忠诚？", "char_start": 661, "char_end": 699}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "如果你谈的是真正的忠诚，那么这事根本没有替代方案。", "char_start": 700, "char_end": 725}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 26}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0212"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：大家可以忍受男朋友什么程度的不忠？我这样的想法是不是过分了呢？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026"], "summary": "围绕“忠诚”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这个问题恐怕要挑战你们的基本观念，但无论如何还是说出来给你们参考。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这个问题恐怕要挑战你们的基本观念，但无论如何还是说出来给你们参考。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 33, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "74a64c05-77d8-543c-8f88-c04cd12b6a47", "source_ordinal": 2711, "reading_ordinal": 1342, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "你的事", "published_at": "2022-06-30T06:41:22+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/487282842/answer/2551554967"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "何谓“xx是某人的事”？这话为什么应该有激励作用？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 25}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "你一定要想好这两点，再跟子女说学习是ta自己的事。", "char_start": 26, "char_end": 51}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "“是xx的事”这个表达其实是非常含混而危险的。它既可以表达这是你的责任，也可以表达这是你的权利。", "char_start": 52, "char_end": 100}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "比如“打扫清洁是清洁阿姨的事”，这里指的是责任。", "char_start": 101, "char_end": 125}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "“买不买ipad是我的事”，这里指的是权利。", "char_start": 126, "char_end": 148}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "父母一说“学习是你的事”，自己觉得这说的是责任，说的是“学习好了受益人是你自己”。", "char_start": 149, "char_end": 190}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "但子女往往理解成“学不学可以随我的便”，理解成这是自己的权利。", "char_start": 191, "char_end": 222}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "更不必说家长们往往还顺口会说“学不好该你自己倒霉，我才不是最倒霉的那个”，更是坐实了这说的是一种“权利”。", "char_start": 223, "char_end": 276}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "你的子女连随便花掉零花钱的权利都还没有得到，ta能得到决定学习还是不学习的权利吗？", "char_start": 277, "char_end": 318}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这只是一番毫无意义的、有害无利的推卸责任罢了。", "char_start": 319, "char_end": 342}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "其实，还有一个角度可以非常清晰的解决这个争议，那就是这个“事”，如果翻译为英文，应该翻译为什么？", "char_start": 344, "char_end": 392}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "Your business，还是 your affair？", "char_start": 393, "char_end": 422}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "看出问题了吗？", "char_start": 423, "char_end": 430}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "business，是一门生计。是你该自己忙、自己热衷、自己追逐的事。", "char_start": 431, "char_end": 465}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "affair，是一件事务。是你的公务，你的职责所在。", "char_start": 466, "char_end": 492}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "问题在于，business不能是别人安排的。作为一个人busy的具体化，别人不能对这一点进行安排。人只能因着自我的驱动而keep busy。所以才有mind your own business。", "char_start": 493, "char_end": 590}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "但少年儿童显然没到可以manage business的时候，学习并不是、也无法是儿童的business,", "char_start": 591, "char_end": 643}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "只能是ta们的affair。", "char_start": 644, "char_end": 658}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "这从另一方面，也是化名为“自由主义”的庸俗自由主义的贻害——这一点在家长之中流行甚广。", "char_start": 660, "char_end": 703}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "子女要习惯配合父母，作为父母的助手和下属存在，父母不需要为“这是我的目的，你要服务于这个目的”对子女感到“不好意思”。", "char_start": 704, "char_end": 763}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "“安排你学习是我的事，我是你的监护人、你被指定的上司，你要配合做好它”，这就是你现在为什么要学习的基本原因。", "char_start": 764, "char_end": 818}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "做人必须学会的不是什么“平等”，而是学会选择上司，争取上司，配合上司，管理上司，有所作为，然后学会当个好上司。", "char_start": 819, "char_end": 874}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "而这一切的核心，都是从学会配合上司中来。", "char_start": 875, "char_end": 895}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "我要负责当一个好上司，向你示范什么是好上司，什么是坏上司，当你学习争取、配合、管理的对手。", "char_start": 896, "char_end": 941}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "你要负责当一个好下属，学习和练习争取、配合和管理上司。", "char_start": 942, "char_end": 969}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "学会服务（serve）这件最困难、但却是人类最需要、也是唯一需要学会的专业。", "char_start": 970, "char_end": 1008}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "而更重要的是，我们不是普通人。", "char_start": 1010, "char_end": 1025}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "We are the servants of people，", "char_start": 1027, "char_end": 1057}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "helpers of the poor，", "char_start": 1058, "char_end": 1078}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "healers of the diseased,", "char_start": 1079, "char_end": 1103}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "guiders in the darkness,", "char_start": 1104, "char_end": 1128}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "bridges over the river，", "char_start": 1129, "char_end": 1152}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "shields between the innocent and harm.", "char_start": 1153, "char_end": 1191}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "This is why we are made,", "char_start": 1193, "char_end": 1217}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "this is what we are meant to be.", "char_start": 1218, "char_end": 1250}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "让别人去寻求平等和自由，", "char_start": 1252, "char_end": 1264}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "我们要帮助人得到平等和自由。", "char_start": 1265, "char_end": 1279}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "你会看到的，", "char_start": 1280, "char_end": 1286}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "这是得到最多自由的最短的路。", "char_start": 1287, "char_end": 1301}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "你看得到人看我的目光，", "char_start": 1303, "char_end": 1314}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "也体会得到我的话对人的力量。", "char_start": 1315, "char_end": 1329}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "我得到的不是“平等”，而是理解、服从，向往和尊敬。", "char_start": 1330, "char_end": 1355}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "你用不着担心“平等”，你要在意的是能不能得到理解、服从、向往和尊敬。", "char_start": 1356, "char_end": 1390}, {"paragraph_id": "P044", "field": "body", "index": 44, "text": "你生在我家，", "char_start": 1392, "char_end": 1398}, {"paragraph_id": "P045", "field": "body", "index": 45, "text": "你不是普通人。", "char_start": 1399, "char_end": 1406}, {"paragraph_id": "P046", "field": "body", "index": 46, "text": "成年以后，你可以选择，", "char_start": 1408, "char_end": 1419}, {"paragraph_id": "P047", "field": "body", "index": 47, "text": "现在，先获得选择。", "char_start": 1420, "char_end": 1429}, {"paragraph_id": "P048", "field": "body", "index": 48, "text": "我要的服务就是学习——不是为你，就是为我。", "char_start": 1431, "char_end": 1452}, {"paragraph_id": "P049", "field": "body", "index": 49, "text": "你要学习，不是因为这是你的事，而确实是因为这是我的事。", "char_start": 1453, "char_end": 1480}, {"paragraph_id": "P050", "field": "body", "index": 50, "text": "如同我服务于你一样，学着服务于我。", "char_start": 1481, "char_end": 1498}, {"paragraph_id": "P051", "field": "body", "index": 51, "text": "Study is not your business，", "char_start": 1499, "char_end": 1526}, {"paragraph_id": "P052", "field": "body", "index": 52, "text": "but your task，", "char_start": 1527, "char_end": 1541}, {"paragraph_id": "P053", "field": "body", "index": 53, "text": "your duty，", "char_start": 1542, "char_end": 1552}, {"paragraph_id": "P054", "field": "body", "index": 54, "text": "your service.", "char_start": 1553, "char_end": 1566}, {"paragraph_id": "P055", "field": "body", "index": 55, "text": "Serve, my little knight.", "char_start": 1568, "char_end": 1592}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 66}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0212"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何告诉孩子，学习是你自己的事？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043", "P044", "P045", "P046", "P047", "P048", "P049", "P050", "P051", "P052", "P053", "P054", "P055"], "summary": "围绕“你的事”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“何谓“xx是某人的事”？这话为什么应该有激励作用？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "何谓“xx是某人的事”？这话为什么应该有激励作用？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 25, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "65213d12-fd12-5848-a55e-f3f5306a5a85", "source_ordinal": 2710, "reading_ordinal": 1343, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "涨跌原理", "published_at": "2022-06-30T08:37:02+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/32023399/answer/2551629443"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "股票涨跌的原理是什么呢。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 12}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "是“长生不灭的企业最后总能赚钱”。", "char_start": 13, "char_end": 30}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "除此之外，全是虚妄。", "char_start": 31, "char_end": 41}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "任何自认为成功的交易策略，都存在捕螳螂的黄雀。", "char_start": 42, "char_end": 65}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "整个投机市场，是一条自噬其尾的黄雀之蛇。", "char_start": 66, "char_end": 86}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "最终决定一切的，是什么样的企业有最健康的理念和机体，有最强的抗风险能力。", "char_start": 87, "char_end": 123}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这往往是一些“用最保守的原则去做最激进的事”的企业。", "char_start": 124, "char_end": 150}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "以及不要拿全副身家去投机——短期涨落不可预测，你可以赌，但不要觉得你一定会赢。", "char_start": 151, "char_end": 190}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 8}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0212"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：股票涨跌的原理是什么？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008"], "summary": "围绕“涨跌原理”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“股票涨跌的原理是什么呢。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "股票涨跌的原理是什么呢。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 12, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "69fb1c20-a7cc-5b0c-82a4-cc1509d87e71", "source_ordinal": 2709, "reading_ordinal": 1344, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "没品笑话", "published_at": "2022-06-30T09:12:52+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/536969993/answer/2551677233"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "是很没品。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 5}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "所以笑完了，可以继续批评ta。", "char_start": 6, "char_end": 21}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "你不需要为被地狱笑话逗笑本身感到很大的不安——我们人类本来在情感直觉上就是这个水平，这种膝跳反应是用来帮助我们下意识回避风险而设计的。", "char_start": 22, "char_end": 89}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这是我们的设计本身所附带的副作用，就和坦克被设计得能扛火力，于是就不可避免很沉重一样。", "char_start": 90, "char_end": 133}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "想笑就笑，不必忌讳。", "char_start": 134, "char_end": 144}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "笑不表示赞同。", "char_start": 145, "char_end": 152}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "笑归笑，反归反，不挨着。", "char_start": 153, "char_end": 165}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 7}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0212"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么突然流行地狱笑话，不觉得很没品吗，特别是对一些死者，一点也不尊重人?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007"], "summary": "围绕“没品笑话”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“是很没品。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "是很没品。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 5, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
